{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_174_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_174","textTraditional":"一、二十有五年。春，齊崔杼帥師伐我北鄙。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_174_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_174","textTraditional":"二、夏五月乙亥，齊崔杼弒其君光。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_174_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_174","textTraditional":"三、公會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、邾婁子、滕子、薛伯、〈木巳〉伯、小邾婁子于陳儀。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_174_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_174","textTraditional":"四、六月壬子，鄭公孫舍之帥師入陳。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_174_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_174","textTraditional":"五、秋八月己巳，諸侯同盟于重丘，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_174_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_174","textTraditional":"六、衞侯入于陳儀。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_174_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_174","textTraditional":"陳儀者何？衞之邑也。曷為不言入于衞？諼君以弒也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_174_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_174","textTraditional":"七、楚屈建帥師滅舒鳩。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_174_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_174","textTraditional":"八、冬，鄭公孫囆帥師伐陳。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_174_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_174","textTraditional":"九、十有二月，吳子謁伐楚，門于巢卒。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_174_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_174","textTraditional":"門于巢卒者何？入門乎巢而卒也。入門乎巢而卒者何？入巢之門而卒也。吳子謁，何以名？傷而返，未至乎舍而卒也。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}